# End-to-end EMULATOR test: Duet3 Mini 5+ (Microchip SAME54P20, run on
# the pin-/register-compatible samd51p20 build) under Renode in tick
# mode. Boots real firmware, completes identify + clocksync, brings up
# the full config (4 TMC2209s on multi-drop UART, 2 software-PWM
# heaters, a heater_fan, endstops, adc_scaled thermistors) and
# round-trips gcode. See "Per-printer tests" in
# test/emulator/README.md for the shared conventions.
#
# Ground specific to this board (samd51_smoke covers boot only):
#   - TMC2209 multi-drop UART (uart_pin PA1 / tx_pin PA0 / select_pins
#     PD0, uart_address 0..3). sw_uart._drive_rx drives the firmware RX
#     bit through the SAMD51 PORT model (gpio_a.OnGPIO); samd51p20.repl
#     declares gpio_a..gpio_d as GPIOPort.SAMD21_GPIO, which serves the
#     layout-identical SAMX5 PortGroup registers.
#   - adc_scaled thermistors via samd51_adc_stub.py. The SAMX5 ADC
#     layout differs from SAMD21's (INPUTCTRL@0x04, SWTRIG@0x14,
#     INTFLAG@0x2E, SYNCBUSY@0x30, RESULT@0x40) so it needs its own
#     stub, which also returns SYNCBUSY=0 so adc_init's busy-waits fall
#     through. vref (7) and vssa (6) carry distinct values so
#     adc_scaled's (vref - vssa) divisor is non-zero.
DICTIONARY samd51p20.dict
CONFIG duet3_mini.cfg
EMULATOR duet3_mini.fixture.json
REQUIRES_EMULATOR  # deterministic-time lockstep needs the real backend

M114
M105
DUMP_TMC STEPPER=stepper_x
DUMP_TMC STEPPER=extruder

EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Loaded MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Configured MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "DUMP_TMC stepper_x"
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "DUMP_TMC extruder"
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "version=0x21"
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "temp=3"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "ZeroDivisionError"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "failed to init"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Unable to read tmc uart"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Unable to write tmc uart"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Internal error"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Got EOF when reading from device"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "failed to init: Timeout"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "ADC out of range"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Timer too close"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Rescheduled timer in the past"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Klippy is shutdown"
